058f9d816be09b164a329f8fd2b61920d5622c60","source_hash":"dac384d85786d47ce15b10e7de0b450eb12890ab513fc7a543d9b9929656ec87","text":"增补（关于遴选医务人员和兽医人员的规则）<第855号，2015年3月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006726-200755-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2777,"end":2807,"target_id":"34dade54e78053212921fb1800a6f1018e85e0fed2948d447c5a91b697c604fd","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006726-200755-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2807,"end":2932,"target_id":"ebe6e4a77a9c84eae1b05593c1f68c0a92f0861289313c40eae0b52a10c2a4c3","source_hash":"f2401c535e1bca1eb944c36b5142f2f2c22fd03a693fb5327fb8d21d76be2904","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）国防大学学生选拔及学费征收规定部分修改如下。\n\n  除第2条第2款的子款外，“「国防大学设立法实施令」”应改为“「国防大学设立法实施令」”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006726-200755-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2932,"end":3000,"target_id":"bc8a0ed534f5b70c678e46b45e1905d7472b1c224f97414d440847992eba08a2","source_hash":"033a93e37b0d029a22d6992ff8a0c9b71f647f68e8a3d63c3f835a341c40152f","text":"  第七条中，“国防大学设立法”改为“「国防大学设立法」”，“国立学校设立令”改为“「国立学校设立令」”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006726-200755-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3000,"end":3087,"target_id":"26b08b185fbfbe9e11d3241eb64b95550b952a49db680a32e307258cc90a332d","source_hash":"64ea18f5487b32079f1f0ced2d68e8ed8024d4ceee5d007c82be8f5fbb6a75b9","text":"增补（为完善法律形式，对《国防及军事设施工程等法》实施细则进行部分修正）<2016年4月11日第891号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006726-200755-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3087,"end":3197,"target_id":"3b34b75eedaf6b3ec6393376b3ef67f2d3c20d7b84ee515180b7144f3d4815c5","source_hash":"87c4cf3b625dd6bab49139f73925583d3d3026b7706af857d00ddab2a661f3a3","text":"增补（根据政府组织法修正案变更部级名称，对包括国防大学学生选拔及学费收取规则在内的5项部级条例进行部分修订）<2017年8月1日第931号条例>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006726-200755-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3197,"end":3218,"target_id":"97736150a976f5e94